  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manafwa Rice Enterprise Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Rice , Beneficiaries: 1,317 Smallholder farmers, of whom 433 are women., , Project funds will be used to: construct storage and rice processing facilities; acquire modern rice processing equipment; purchased a truck to move produce and the final products; provide additional working capital; hire additional technical staff; and upgrade Manafwas business systems. ,</narrative>
  </description>
